    --- @param ox Origin offset (x-axis).
    --- @param oy Origin offset (y-axis).
    --- @param kx Shearing factor (x-axis).
    --- @param ky Shearing factor (y-axis).
    function drawLayer(texture: Texture, layerindex: number, quad: Quad, x: number | nil, y: number | nil, r: number | nil, sx: number | nil, sy: number | nil, ox: number | nil, oy: number | nil, kx: number | nil, ky: number | nil): nil
    --- Draws a layer of an Array Texture.
    --- Draws a layer of an Array Texture using the specified Transform.
